{"title":"gitlab_sec","url":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/categories/security/","favicon":"https://about.gitlab.com/images/ico/favicon.ico","elements":[{"title":"One vulnerability view: From scanner coverage to AI governance","contents":"<div class=\"image\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><img data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1781621337/mtjqzed2cqtef0frmor2.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1781621337/mtjqzed2cqtef0frmor2.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" fetch-priority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1781621337/mtjqzed2cqtef0frmor2.png\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"></div><h2 class=\"sr-only\" data-v-329ca616=\"\">Featured post</h2><div class=\"text\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading4-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><!--[-->One vulnerability view: From scanner coverage to AI governance<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-heading5\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><!--[-->As AI writes more code, security must keep pace. GitLab is one platform for all scanner coverage, detection, and remediation, with AI governance over agents.<!--]--><!----></p><span class=\"slp-text-body3-bold author\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><!--[-->Author: Alisa Ho<!--]--><!----></span><a class=\"cta slp-mt-16 slp-btn slp-btn-primary cta slp-mt-16\" data-ga-name=\"one vulnerability view: from scanner coverage to ai governance\" data-ga-location=\"body\" href=\"/blog/one-vulnerability-view/\" data-v-c6fd7cb9=\"\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><!--[-->Read Post<!--]--></a></div>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/one-vulnerability-view/","retrieved":1782727635214},{"title":"Full security scanner coverage of your codebase in minutes","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/security-configuration-profiles/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"full security scanner coverage of your codebase in minutes\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1779189265/iqzyhhiwagxzwywvjzow.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1779189265/iqzyhhiwagxzwywvjzow.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1779189265/iqzyhhiwagxzwywvjzow.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Full security scanner coverage of your codebase in minutes<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security configuration profiles lead to faster scanner rollouts. Learn how this new capability in GitLab 19.0 covers thousands of projects in minutes, no gaps.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/security-configuration-profiles/","retrieved":1782727635218},{"title":"Reduce supply chain risk with SBOM-based dependency scanning","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/sbom-based-dependency-scanning/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"reduce supply chain risk with sbom-based dependency scanning\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1779189265/iqzyhhiwagxzwywvjzow.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1779189265/iqzyhhiwagxzwywvjzow.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1779189265/iqzyhhiwagxzwywvjzow.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Reduce supply chain risk with SBOM-based dependency scanning<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Detect transitive dependencies, trace how they entered your project, and prioritize them by real-world exposure.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/sbom-based-dependency-scanning/","retrieved":1782727635220},{"title":"Manage CI/CD credentials with GitLab Secrets Manager","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/secrets-manager-in-public-beta/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"manage ci/cd credentials with gitlab secrets manager\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1779189265/iqzyhhiwagxzwywvjzow.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1779189265/iqzyhhiwagxzwywvjzow.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1779189265/iqzyhhiwagxzwywvjzow.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Manage CI/CD credentials with GitLab Secrets Manager<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Each secret is scoped to its environment or branch and governed by the same controls you use for code. Join the public beta in GitLab 19.0.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/secrets-manager-in-public-beta/","retrieved":1782727635221},{"title":"5 ways to fix misleading vulnerability severities with policy","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/severity-override-vulnerability-management-policy/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"5 ways to fix misleading vulnerability severities with policy\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1772630163/akp8ly2mrsfrhsb0liyb.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1772630163/akp8ly2mrsfrhsb0liyb.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1772630163/akp8ly2mrsfrhsb0liyb.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->5 ways to fix misleading vulnerability severities with policy<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Default CVSS scores don't reflect your actual risk. Use GitLab severity override policies to automate adjustments based on CVE, CWE, file path, and directory.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/severity-override-vulnerability-management-policy/","retrieved":1782727635222},{"title":"Harden your pipeline perimeter for the era of AI-assisted coding","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/harden-pipeline-perimeter-for-ai-assisted-coding/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"harden your pipeline perimeter for the era of ai-assisted coding\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1765809212/noh0mdfn9o94ry9ykura.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1765809212/noh0mdfn9o94ry9ykura.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1765809212/noh0mdfn9o94ry9ykura.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Harden your pipeline perimeter for the era of AI-assisted coding<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->The pipeline is now where humans, agents, and third-party code converge. Companies need a control plane that sees, enforces, and fixes every change.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/harden-pipeline-perimeter-for-ai-assisted-coding/","retrieved":1782727635224},{"title":"Limit credential exposure with fine-grained personal access tokens","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/fine-grained-pats/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"limit credential exposure with fine-grained personal access tokens\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1772029801/qk75nu1eezxa6aiefpup.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1772029801/qk75nu1eezxa6aiefpup.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1772029801/qk75nu1eezxa6aiefpup.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Limit credential exposure with fine-grained personal access tokens<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Explore tokens that carry only the permissions they need, and nothing more. Then join the beta program.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/fine-grained-pats/","retrieved":1782727635225},{"title":"Prepare your pipeline for AI-discovered zero-days","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/prepare-your-pipeline-for-ai-discovered-zero-days/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"prepare your pipeline for ai-discovered zero-days\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1772195014/ooezwusxjl1f7ijfmbvj.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1772195014/ooezwusxjl1f7ijfmbvj.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1772195014/ooezwusxjl1f7ijfmbvj.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Prepare your pipeline for AI-discovered zero-days<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->AI is finding vulnerabilities faster than teams can patch. Learn how pipeline enforcement, automated triage, and AI remediation close the gap.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/prepare-your-pipeline-for-ai-discovered-zero-days/","retrieved":1782727635227},{"title":"Manage vulnerability noise at scale with auto-dismiss policies","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/auto-dismiss-vulnerability-management-policy/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"manage vulnerability noise at scale with auto-dismiss policies\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1774375772/kpaaaiqhokevxxeoxvu0.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1774375772/kpaaaiqhokevxxeoxvu0.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1774375772/kpaaaiqhokevxxeoxvu0.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Manage vulnerability noise at scale with auto-dismiss policies<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Learn how to cut through scanner noise and focus on the vulnerabilities that matter most with GitLab security, including use cases and templates.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/auto-dismiss-vulnerability-management-policy/","retrieved":1782727635228},{"title":"GitLab 18.10 brings AI-native triage and remediation","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/gitlab-18-10-brings-ai-native-triage-and-remediation/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"gitlab 18.10 brings ai-native triage and remediation \" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1773843921/rm35fx4gylrsu9alf2fx.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1773843921/rm35fx4gylrsu9alf2fx.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1773843921/rm35fx4gylrsu9alf2fx.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->GitLab 18.10 brings AI-native triage and remediation <!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Learn about GitLab Duo Agent Platform capabilities that cut noise, surface real vulnerabilities, and turn findings into proposed fixes.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/gitlab-18-10-brings-ai-native-triage-and-remediation/","retrieved":1782727635229}]}